# Private provider task state.
#
# Contains raw provider task ids, which exist only so an interrupted generation
# can resume the SAME task instead of paying for a second one. They are runtime
# state by definition and must never be committed. Matched repository-wide and
# anchored on the directory name, because the provider accepts any work_dir: a
# rule tied to the default output path would not cover a custom one.
**/task-state/

# Belt and braces: the files themselves, in case the directory is ever renamed.
task-state/
*.task-state.json
